==Description==
The '''Snowy''' was an enemy that first appeared in the second phase of [[Krampus Frosthold]] as part of the [[Krampus' Revenge Event]]. It had above average speed and a fairly low health for its debut, though it spawned in large hordes to compensate.

==Appearance==
The '''Snowy''' was a humanoid entirely made out of ice. It had light a blue head and arms, with a light grey torso and legs. It had two white eyes and a snarling monster face. It wobbled as it walked.

==Strategy==
*Area of effect towers, like the [[Mortar]], [[Pursuit]] or [[Golden Pyromancer]] can be very useful against this, as this generally spawns in hordes.
*High DPS towers, like the [[Accelerator]] or [[Golden Minigunner]] can be very useful against these.

